WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.909 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  bag remake studio  in shonen japan repairs designer bags  and accessories  [Music]  this 800 monogram wallet is an  unmistakable louis vuitton staple  the owner uses it on a daily basis and  now the lining is deteriorating  the leather is discolored and the paint  is peeling on the edges  one of the studio's repairmen will show  us how they restore this wallet  by taking it apart repainting it  creating new linings  and stitching it all back together  first the artist takes the bag apart in  order to work on  each piece separately  he uses a seam ripper to carefully take  out the thread  after he takes off the outer shell of  the wallet he uses a sewing owl to take  out the internal threads  [Music]  next he'll move on to fixing the  severely discolored leather  he starts by color matching the brown  shade of the wallet  this shade is made by combining black  yellow  red and white leather paints  [Music]  once he has a perfect match he uses a  paintbrush to slowly start coating the  discolored parts of the leather  won't touch the signature monogram this  preserves the authenticity of the piece  [Music]  after years of rubbing against money the  interior lining  needs to be replaced the customer  requested a nylon lining  [Music]  to do this the repairman cuts out the  new lining with a sharp  knife using the exterior of the wallet  as a stencil  [Music]  he coats the wallet in glue and presses  the new lining onto each piece  once the piece is dry they are ready to  come back together  the artisan sews them slowly carefully  ensuring  each stitch goes into the exact same  hole as the original  [Music]  once the three main pieces of the wallet  are assembled the artisan  glues and sews them together  [Music]  [Music]  to finish this repair he paints the  edges of the wallet where it's peeling  with an edge coat  [Music]  this ensures that all of the wallet's  corners are sealed  the final step is to hand rub the whole  wallet with mink oil  which will prevent the leather from  peeling or getting discolored  and will extend its life for years to  come  [Music]  you

